252frrv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reliable Recipe Viewer (RRV)</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcassiancc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cassiancc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fJFronny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JFronny</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fscaleme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scale Me</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKd_Gaming1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kd_Gaming1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsearchables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Searchables</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fjaredlll08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jaredlll08</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsound-controller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Controller</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBVengo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BVengo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforcecloseworldloadingscreen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">kennytv's Force Close Loading Screen</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkennytv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">kennytv</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwavey-capes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wavey Capes</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ftr7zw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">tr7zw</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fzoomify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zoomify</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fisxander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">isxander</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🎨 光影與視覺效果&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders – Unbound</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEminGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EminGT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fIMS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IMS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fmakeup-ultra-fast-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp – Ultra Fast</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKDXavier\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KDXavier</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🛠️ 設定與函式庫&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fshedaniel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shedaniel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmodmuss50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modmuss50</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmodmuss50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modmuss50</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffzzy-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fzzy Config</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffzzyhmstrs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">fzzyhmstrs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flibjf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibJF</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fJFronny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JFronny</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fplaceholder-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Text Placeholder API</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPatbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patbox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fui-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UI Lib</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fDAQEMStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DAQEM Studios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib (YACL)</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fisxander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">isxander</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🎨 資源包&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdefrosted_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Defrosted</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252flooshy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">looshy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffurfsky-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Furfsky Reborn</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTylerrrr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tylerrrr</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhypixel-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hypixel Plus</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fic22487\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ic22487</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flooshy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Looshy</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252flooshy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">looshy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpackshq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PacksHQ</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPacksHQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PacksHQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fskyblock-dark-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SkyBlock Dark UI</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fjani270\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jani270</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdark-mode-skyblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SkyBlock Dark Mode</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fic22487\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ic22487</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsophies-enchant-books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophie's Hypixel SkyBlock Enchantment Books</a> by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBentcheesee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bentcheesee</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f9abbe45bebb44d629ec6113cae5a66e5137054c.webp\" alt=\"顯示 F.A.Q 的裝飾分隔線\"></p>\n<p>&lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🧩 一般問題&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>問：SkyBlock Enhanced 是什麼？</strong><br>\n答：一個為 <strong>Fabric</strong> 環境下的 <strong>Minecraft 26.1+</strong> 預先設定好的 Hypixel SkyBlock 模組整合包。內含 60 多款最佳化模組、首次啟動嚮導、六種解析度預設值以及遊戲內設定管理器——無需手動設定，安裝即可遊玩。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以在 Hypixel 上使用嗎？</strong><br>\n答：可以。所有內建的模組都符合 Hypixel 規範，僅為客戶端（Client-side）使用，且不會自動化遊戲操作。在新增自己的模組前，請務必查看 Hypixel 的最新規則。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我需要手動設定任何東西嗎？</strong><br>\n答：不需要——透過 Modrinth App 安裝、啟動遊戲、依照嚮導指示操作即可開始遊玩。</p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;⚙️ 安裝與設定&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>問：如何安裝？</strong><br>\n答：使用 Modrinth App——請參考上方的安裝步驟。</p>\n<p><strong>問：遊戲無法啟動或發生崩潰。</strong><br>\n答：請配置更多記憶體（RAM）。若看到「Resource Reload Failed」錯誤，請加入啟動參數 <code>-Xss4M</code>，並確保使用的是相容且最新版的 Java 運行環境（Modrinth App 會自動處理此部分）。仍有問題嗎？歡迎加入 Discord 尋求協助。</p>\n<p><strong>問：如何更新？</strong><br>\n答：在 Modrinth App 中點擊 <strong>更新整合包（Update pack）</strong>，然後選擇最新版本即可。</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🚀 效能&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 它能在低階電腦上運行嗎？</strong><br>\nA: 可以——在設定精靈中選擇<strong>效能</strong>設定檔。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 支援光影嗎？</strong><br>\nA: 支援——已包含 Iris 搭配 Complementary Unbound 與 MakeUp Ultra Fast。開啟光影時，部分疊層可能無法正確顯示。</p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;🧰 自訂&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 有哪些解析度預設值？</strong><br>\nA: 六種：<strong>1080p 2×</strong>、<strong>1080p 3×</strong>、<strong>1440p</strong>、<strong>1440p 超寬螢幕</strong>、<strong>4K</strong> 和 <strong>4K 超寬螢幕</strong>——首次啟動時會自動套用。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 我可以重設或分享我的設定嗎？</strong><br>\nA: 可以——遊戲內的設定管理器可處理備份、還原、匯出與匯入。</p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt; &lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;💬 支援與社群&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 我該去哪裡尋求協助或回報錯誤？</strong><br>\nA: 加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pdwxyjTta7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。如果您偏好隱私導向的伺服器，也可以使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffluxer.gg%252f3jJy9cp6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluxer</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 我該如何支持這個專案？</strong><br>\nA: 透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkdgaming1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 贊助，或使用 <strong>Bisect Hosting</strong> 的優惠碼 <strong>SBE</strong> 享受 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>社群與支援</h2>\n<p>需要協助、想分享設定檔，或是尋找更新資訊？加入 Discord 即可取得支援頻道、設定檔分享區與版本發布公告。同時也提供隱私導向的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffluxer.gg%252f3jJy9cp6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluxer</a> 伺服器。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pdwxyjTta7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>支持專案</h2>\n<p>捐款將用於持續的更新與維護——每一份支持都備受感謝。需要遊戲伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼 <strong>SBE</strong> 可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fSBE%253fr%253dSkyblockEnhancedModrinthPage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a> 獲得 <strong>25% 折扣</strong>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkdgaming1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01502d9d41e784dfa18a3a1903a3e906cde1af1f.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting promotional banner\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>感謝您選擇 <strong>SkyBlock Enhanced</strong> ——一款現代化、高度優化且完整配置的 Hypixel SkyBlock 整合包。如果您喜歡它，請在 Modrinth 上為它點<strong>愛心</strong>、<strong>加入社群</strong>，並<strong>分享給朋友</strong>。</p>\n<p>祝您刷寶愉快！</p>\n<p>—— <strong>Kd_Gaming1</strong></p>\n<p><em>特別感謝所有為這些模組付出的開發者，以及為圖標設計的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ic22487\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@ic22487</a>。</em></p>",
